==Battleground==
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Nothing spawns at the start, so stall for max money. Once you hit the base, kill One Horn with Whale Cat spam and then deal with Master A. with your usual methods. If you (somehow) still can't clear it, just wait 75 minutes (or 37.5 with a Speed Up and 25 minutes with x3 Speed Up) without sending out anything and [[Ms. Sign]]s will clog up the enemy limit.

